Question 2: Spring Boot Data JPA – Hospital Patient Management
System (@OneToMany Bidirectional)
Scenario
Develop a Spring Boot application for a Hospital Management System where one Doctor can treat
multiple Patients. Store doctor and patient details using Spring Data JPA and establish a
Bidirectional One-to-Many relationship. In this application, navigation should be possible from
Doctor to Patient and from Patient to Doctor.
