2. Configure a Bidirectional @OneToMany relationship using mappedBy.
3. Save one Doctor with multiple Patients.
4. Retrieve Doctor details along with Patient information.
5. Retrieve Patient details along with assigned Doctor information.
6. Use Spring Data JPA Repository.
7. Display data using CommandLineRunner.
